    <description>Tutanota is the world's most secure email service, easy to use and private by design. Sign up for free encrypted email now.

With end-to-end encryption and 2FA, your emails have never been more secure. The built-in encryption guarantees that your mailbox belongs to you: Nobody can decrypt or read your data.

**Please Note**: This is an automatically updated package. If you find it is out of date by more than a day or two, please contact the maintainer(s) and let them know the package is no longer updating correctly.</description>
    <summary>Tutanota is an email client with a strong focus on security and privacy that lets you encrypt emails on all your devices.</summary>
    <releaseNotes># What's new

- Drive: single-file sharing via public link [#11829](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11829)

# Bugfixes and Improvements

- close context menus and similar modals by right-clicking [#11695](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11695)
- Drive: fix remaining transfer time sometimes not being shown or flickering [#11771](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11771)
- Drive: fix transfer progress being reported incorrectly when uploading many small files [#11771](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11771)
- fix AssertNotNull failed on mail.serverClassificationData when handling incoming mails [#11884](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11884)

# Dependencies

- updated DOMPurify to 3.5.0 [#11890](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11890)
- updated Electron to 45.4.1

# Milestone

https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/milestone/467?closed=1

